{"version":3,"kind":"Article","sha256":"10b45539a980c26efba9e88fb364ef7788a0e242c7845579fbfef5e967575874","slug":"index","location":"/index.md","dependencies":[],"frontmatter":{"title":"Mapping Crime in Sydney: Spatial Hotspots and Socioeconomic Drivers Across Local Government Areas","content_includes_title":false,"thumbnail":"/e18f93c1a505d76c1d42cf6b874a6a0d.png","exports":[{"format":"md","filename":"index.md","url":"/index-9c872960f9b9991889e78db56d76b1ff.md"}]},"mdast":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"block","children":[{"type":"heading","depth":2,"position":{"start":{"line":3,"column":1},"end":{"line":3,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Overview","position":{"start":{"line":3,"column":1},"end":{"line":3,"column":1}},"key":"lniHMPeZh5"}],"identifier":"overview","label":"Overview","html_id":"overview","implicit":true,"key":"Mq1kESMLwh"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":4,"column":1},"end":{"line":5,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Crime reference (why understanding crime is important).... I am a book about ... something!\nUnderstanding the spatial distribution of crime is important because crime can vary considerably between different communities and locations. In Sydney, identifying where violent, property and drug offences are concentrated can help reveal areas that may require greater attention for crime prevention, policing and community support. This project uses spatial analysis to identify patterns and hotspots across selected Local Government Areas between 2015 and 2025, providing a geographic understanding of how crime is distributed over time.","position":{"start":{"line":4,"column":1},"end":{"line":4,"column":1}},"key":"Tl71l1eG3q"}],"key":"ujXb8F0I8t"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1},"end":{"line":7,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Importantly, this project also investigates whether differences in crime rates are associated with socioeconomic conditions, specifically unemployment, household income and high-school completion. Examining these relationships spatially can provide insight into whether areas experiencing higher crime also display particular socioeconomic characteristics. Understanding these patterns can contribute to more targeted approaches to crime prevention and resource allocation, while recognising that socioeconomic factors do not necessarily cause crime.","position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1},"end":{"line":7,"column":1}},"key":"YrMQe3FcT5"}],"key":"ra0BGxpgZW"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"position":{"start":{"line":10,"column":1},"end":{"line":10,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Aims and Objectives","position":{"start":{"line":10,"column":1},"end":{"line":10,"column":1}},"key":"X9Ozfis8xb"}],"identifier":"aims-and-objectives","label":"Aims and Objectives","html_id":"aims-and-objectives","implicit":true,"key":"YXLjxEaEdV"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":15,"column":1},"end":{"line":15,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Wikipedia has ","position":{"start":{"line":15,"column":1},"end":{"line":15,"column":1}},"key":"xgQrZ6uJMs"},{"type":"link","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/book","position":{"start":{"line":15,"column":1},"end":{"line":15,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"information about books","position":{"start":{"line":15,"column":1},"end":{"line":15,"column":1}},"key":"P0IqLrYjuW"}],"urlSource":"wiki:book","data":{"page":"book","wiki":"https://en.wikipedia.org/","lang":"en"},"internal":false,"protocol":"wiki","key":"VNfDUXKenV"},{"type":"text","value":": hover over the link for more information.","position":{"start":{"line":15,"column":1},"end":{"line":15,"column":1}},"key":"GiXGA7ZNhl"}],"key":"XeMzFenjek"},{"type":"comment","value":"An admonition containing a note","position":{"start":{"line":17,"column":1},"end":{"line":17,"column":1}},"key":"lWh441laBo"},{"type":"admonition","kind":"note","children":[{"type":"admonitionTitl